  "solution": "The logic followed here is,\n\n**Logic:** First no. = [{(Second no.) - (Third no.)} × 9]\n\n**(261, 54, 25) →**\n\n​⇒ [{(54) - (25)} × 9]\n\n​⇒ (29 × 9) = 261\n\n**(270, 45, 15) →**\n\n​⇒ [{(45) - (15)} × 9]\n\n​⇒ (30 × 9) = 270\n\nChecking all the given options as per the logic:\n\n**1. **(298, 67, 45) →\n\n​⇒ [{(67) - (45)} × 9]\n\n​⇒ (22 × 9) = 198\n\n**2. **(182, 87, 69) →\n\n​⇒ [{(87) - (69)} × 9]\n\n​⇒ (18 × 9) = 162\n\n**3. (288, 82, 50) →**\n\n​⇒ [{(82) - (50)} × 9]\n\n​⇒ (32 × 9) = **288**\n\n**4. **(236, 80, 56) →\n\n​⇒ [{(80) - (56)} × 9]\n\n​⇒ (24 × 9) = 216\n\nHere, **(288, 82, 50)** shows a similar relation to the given set of pairs.\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"**(288, 82, 50)**\".\n\n4f:Td7b,\n\nयहाँ",
